{"path":"locale/moneypunct/thousands_sep","title":"std::moneypunct<CharT,International>::thousands_sep, do_thousands_sep","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::moneypunct&lt;CharT,International&gt;::</span>thousands_sep, do_thousands_sep","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct/thousands_sep","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"The object of type char_type to use as the thousands separator. In common U.S. locales, this is ',' or L','.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>char_type thousands_sep<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> char_type do_thousands_sep<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Public member function, calls the member function <code>do_thousands_sep</code> of the most derived class.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns the character to be used as the separator between digit groups when parsing or formatting the integral parts of monetary values. </div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The object of type <code>char_type</code> to use as the thousands separator. In common U.S. locales, this is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">','</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">L<span class=\"st0\">','</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> space_out <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct\"><span class=\"kw1989\">std::<span class=\"me2\">moneypunct</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    pattern do_pos_format<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>value, none, none, none<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> do_frac_digits<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    char_type do_thousands_sep<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    string_type do_grouping<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es5\">\\002</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF-8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"american locale: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/showbase\"><span class=\"kw1783\">std::<span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/put_money\"><span class=\"kw1816\">std::<span class=\"me2\">put_money</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">12345678.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">getloc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, new space_out<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"locale with modified moneypunct: \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/put_money\"><span class=\"kw1816\">std::<span class=\"me2\">put_money</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">12345678.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>american locale: $123,456.78\nlocale with modified moneypunct: 12 34 56 78</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct/grouping\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_grouping</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the numbers of digits between each pair of thousands separators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/moneypunct","title":"std::moneypunct"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::moneypunct<CharT,International>::thousands_sep, do_thousands_sep","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Public member function, calls the member function do_thousands_sep of the most derived class."},{"label":"Return value","note":"The object of type char_type to use as the thousands separator. In common U.S